#: src/telephony/ui/windows/advanced_settings_window.py:222
msgid ""
"When the modem stops responding, the phone quietly runs the recovery steps "
"by itself: phone service restart, radio restart, modem power cycle, firmware "
"restart and re-enabling a disabled radio. The phone is never rebooted "
"automatically. If nothing helps you are asked to reboot. When this is off, "
"the Modem Recovery window opens instead so you can run the steps yourself."
msgstr ""
"Modem ikasiya kuyankha, foni imayendetsa yokha mwakachetechete njira "
"zokonzera: kuyambitsanso ntchito ya foni, kuyambitsanso wailesi, kuzimitsa "
"ndi kuyatsanso modem, kuyambitsanso firmware ya modem ndi kuyatsanso wailesi "
"yozimitsidwa. Foni siyambitsidwanso yokha. Ngati palibe chothandiza, "
"mudzapemphedwa kuyambitsanso foni. Izi zikazimitsidwa, zenera la Kukonzanso "
"Modem limatsegulidwa m'malo mwake kuti muyendetse nokha njirazo."

