#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:394
msgid ""
"The Default Country Code is used to format numbers that don't include an "
"international prefix (e.g., +358).\n"
"\n"
"If left empty, the system tries to detect it automatically from your SIM "
"card or network.\n"
"\n"
"You can manually override it here by entering a 2-letter ISO region code (e."
"g. US, FI, DE) or a calling code (e.g. +358, 358, +1, 1)."
msgstr ""
"Khodi Yadziko Yosasinthika imagwiritsidwa ntchito kupanga manambala omwe "
"sakhala ndi mawu oyambira padziko lonse lapansi (monga +358).\n"
"\n"
"Ngati isiyidwa yopanda kanthu, makinawa amayesa kuti azindikire okha "
"kuchokera ku SIM khadi kapena maukonde.\n"
"\n"
"Mungathe kuichotsa pano poika khodi ya dera la ISO ya zilembo ziwiri (monga "
"US, FI, DE) kapena nambala yoyimbira (monga +358, 358, +1, 1)."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:422
msgid ""
"Carriers limit how large a multimedia message can be. Images and videos you "
"attach are automatically compressed to fit under this limit before sending.\n"
"\n"
"600 kB is a safe default for most carriers. Pick a smaller value if your "
"messages fail to send, or a larger one if you know your carrier allows it."
msgstr ""
"Makampani a foni amaika malire a kukula kwa uthenga wa multimedia. Zithunzi "
"ndi mavidiyo omwe mumatumiza amachepetsedwa okha kuti akwane malire "
"asanatumizidwe.\n"
"\n"
"600 kB ndi muyeso wokhazikika wotetezeka kwa makampani ambiri. Sankhani "
"muyeso wocheperapo ngati mauthenga anu akulephera kutumizidwa, kapena "
"waukulupo ngati mukudziwa kuti kampani yanu imalola."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:443
msgid ""
"The ringback tone is the sound played (toot-toot-toot) while waiting for an "
"outgoing call to be answered. Some carriers don't generate it so we have "
"option to generate it manually here. \n"
"\n"
"You can select your own music file, or clear it to use the standard system "
"tone."
msgstr ""
"Kamvekedwe ka ringback ndi kamvekedwe kamene kamaseweredwa (toot-toot-toot) "
"podikirira kuti foni yotuluka iyankhidwe. Onyamula ena sapanga kotero tili "
"ndi mwayi wopanga pamanja pano. \n"
"\n"
"Mutha kusankha fayilo yanu yanyimbo, kapena kuyimitsa kuti mugwiritse "
"ntchito kamvekedwe kake kachitidwe."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:463
msgid "Select Ringback Tone"
msgstr "Sankhani Ringback Tone"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:471
msgid "Audio Files"
msgstr "Mafayilo Omvera"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:497
msgid ""
"Select the address books to use with Telephony and arrange them in order of "
"priority. The topmost address book has the highest priority and will be "
"preferred if a number is found in multiple address books. You can use the "
"Duplicate Resolver toggle below to help manage duplicates, but even if "
"disabled, we encourage enabling it for a better experience."
msgstr ""
"Sankhani mabuku a maadiresi oti mugwiritse ntchito ndi Telephony ndi "
"kuwakonza m'njira yofunika kwambiri. Buku la maadiresi lapamwamba kwambiri "
"ndilofunika kwambiri ndipo lidzakondedwa ngati nambala ikupezeka m'mabuku "
"angapo a maadiresi. Mutha kugwiritsa ntchito kusintha kwa Duplicate Resolver "
"pansipa kuti muthandizire kuyang'anira zobwereza, koma ngakhale "
"zitalephereka, timalimbikitsa kuzipangitsa kuti zikhale bwino."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:516
msgid ""
"When enabled, if the same phone number calls you 3 times within 5 minutes, "
"the third call (and subsequent ones within the window) will force the phone "
"to ring at maximum volume, bypassing Silent or Do Not Disturb modes."
msgstr ""
"Ikayatsidwa, ngati nambala yafoni yomweyi ikuyimbirani nthawi za 3 mkati mwa "
"mphindi 5, kuyimba kwachitatu (ndi zina zotsatiridwa pawindo) zidzakakamiza "
"foniyo kuti ilire kwambiri, ndikudutsa njira za Silent kapena Osasokoneza."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:528
msgid ""
"Choose contacts that will always play notifications at full volume, even "
"when the phone is in Silent or Do Not Disturb mode."
msgstr ""
"Sankhani omwe amalumikizana nawo omwe azisewera zidziwitso nthawi zonse, "
"ngakhale foni ikakhala mu Silent kapena Osasokoneza."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:549
msgid "Unknown Callers"
msgstr "Oyimba Osadziwika"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:554
msgid "Unknown Callers Action"
msgstr "Osadziwika Oyimba Ntchito"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:556
