msgstr "Dzina (monga Amayi)"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:888
msgid ""
"This is the call volume for each output. The level applies automatically "
"when a call connects and whenever the output changes during a call, and "
"slider changes are heard live. The hardware applies levels in coarse steps, "
"and the earpiece never goes fully silent. The Bluetooth level is stored for "
"upcoming routing support."
msgstr ""
"Uwu ndi mulingo wa mawu a foni pa njira iliyonse yotulutsira mawu. Mulingowu "
"umagwira ntchito wokha foni ikalumikizidwa komanso nthawi iliyonse njira "
"yotulutsira mawu ikasintha pa foni, ndipo kusintha kwa cholowetsera "
"kumamveka nthawi yomweyo. Hardware imagwiritsa ntchito milingo m'masitepe "
"akuluakulu, ndipo sipika ya m'khutu siikhala chete kwathunthu. Mulingo wa "
"Bluetooth umasungidwa kuti udzagwiritsidwe ntchito posintha njira mtsogolo."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:897
msgid "Decline Message"
msgstr "Akana Uthenga"

